{"title":"Career Roadmap · School Sports Coordinator","role":"School Sports Coordinator","summary":"A School Sports Coordinator plans, manages and develops the sports and physical-education ecosystem of a school.","facts":{"Current degree":"Other Teacher Education (D.El.Ed / B.El.Ed / B.P.Ed / ITEP / Integrated B.Sc-B.Ed / BA-B.Ed)","Course":"Physical Education (B.P.Ed)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A School Sports Coordinator plans, manages and develops the sports and physical-education ecosystem of a school."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines physical education, sports administration, event management, student development, coaching coordination and school operations."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Planning the annual sports calendar"},{"text":"Coordinating school teams"},{"text":"Organizing inter-house and inter-school competitions"},{"text":"Managing sports facilities and equipment"},{"text":"Coordinating coaches and PE teachers"},{"text":"Identifying student talent"},{"text":"Maintaining participation and performance records"},{"text":"Organizing tournaments and sports days"},{"text":"Coordinating transportation and logistics for competitions"},{"text":"Supporting student fitness and physical-activity programs"},{"text":"Ensuring appropriate safety and safeguarding practices"},{"text":"Communicating with parents, schools and sporting organizations"},{"text":"The role is broader than simply teaching physical education."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12 / Equivalent","B.P.Ed / Relevant Physical Education Qualification","Teaching / Sports Internship","Physical Education Teacher / Sports Instructor","Sports Activity Coordinator","School Sports Coordinator","Senior Sports Coordinator","Head of Physical Education / Sports","School Sports Director","Sports Program Manager / Institutional Sports Head"]},{"type":"p","text":"For larger schools, the pathway may also be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Physical Education Teacher","Team Coach / Sports Lead","Sports Coordinator","Head – Sports & Physical Education"]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"School Sports Coordinator is generally an experience-based coordination role. A fresh B.P.Ed graduate may initially enter as a Physical Education Teacher, Sports Instructor, Coach or Sports Activity Executive before moving into coordination."}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Physical Education Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Core Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Foundations of physical education"},{"text":"Anatomy"},{"text":"Physiology"},{"text":"Health education"},{"text":"Fitness fundamentals"},{"text":"Sports psychology"},{"text":"Educational psychology"},{"text":"Teaching methodology"},{"text":"Introduction to different sports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Sports"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the institution:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Athletics"},{"text":"Football"},{"text":"Basketball"},{"text":"Volleyball"},{"text":"Cricket"},{"text":"Badminton"},{"text":"Kho-Kho"},{"text":"Kabaddi"},{"text":"Yoga"},{"text":"Gymnastics"},{"text":"The student should develop competency in multiple sports rather than specializing in only one."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Coaching & Sports Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Students develop deeper practical and management capabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"Coaching"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Skill demonstration"},{"text":"Practice planning"},{"text":"Warm-up and cool-down"},{"text":"Fitness conditioning"},{"text":"Basic tactical concepts"},{"text":"Team formation"},{"text":"Performance observation"},{"text":"Competition preparation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sports Administration"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tournament planning"},{"text":"Fixtures"},{"text":"Team registration"},{"text":"Sports records"},{"text":"Equipment management"},{"text":"Venue management"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Event budgeting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Student Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how sport contributes to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Discipline"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Teamwork"},{"text":"Confidence"},{"text":"Physical fitness"},{"text":"Social development"},{"text":"Emotional development"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Year — School Sports Operations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The final stage should focus heavily on practical implementation."},{"type":"h","text":"Sports Calendar"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Annual sports calendar"},{"text":"Inter-house competition schedule"},{"text":"Inter-school participation calendar"},{"text":"Practice schedules"},{"text":"Fitness programs"},{"text":"Sports-day plans"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sports Event Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Event planning"},{"text":"Registration"},{"text":"Fixtures"},{"text":"Officials"},{"text":"Venue allocation"},{"text":"Equipment"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Announcements"},{"text":"Results"},{"text":"Certificates"},{"text":"Reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"School Sports Administration"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand coordination between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Principal","Sports Coordinator","PE Teachers / Coaches","Student Teams","Parents / External Organizations"]}]},{"heading":"Core Technical Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Target Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Physical Education"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Sports Coaching"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Fitness Training"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Sports Event Management"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Tournament Planning"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Sports Administration"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Student Talent Identification"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Team Management"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Sports Safety"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"First Aid"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Sports Psychology"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Sports Analytics"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Excel / Google Sheets"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Budget Management"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Digital Sports Management"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"AI & Data Literacy"},{"text":"Intermediate"}]]}]},{"heading":"Sports Coordination Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Annual School Objectives","Sports Calendar","Sport-wise Planning","Coach / Teacher Allocation","Student Registration & Selection","Training Schedule","Internal Competitions","Inter-School Competitions","Performance Tracking","Tournament Participation","Results & Recognition","Annual Sports Review"]}]},{"heading":"Annual Sports Calendar","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A competent coordinator should be able to build an annual calendar covering:"},{"type":"table","header":["Period","Activity"],"rows":[[{"text":"Term Start"},{"text":"Student sports registration"}],[{"text":"Early Term"},{"text":"Fitness assessment"}],[{"text":"Term 1"},{"text":"House competitions"}],[{"text":"Mid Term"},{"text":"Team selection"}],[{"text":"Mid/Late Term"},{"text":"Inter-school competitions"}],[{"text":"Annual Sports Day"},{"text":"Track & field / team events"}],[{"text":"Throughout Year"},{"text":"Coaching & practice"}],[{"text":"End of Year"},{"text":"Performance review"}],[{"text":"Year End"},{"text":"Sports awards & reporting"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact calendar should be adapted to the school's academic calendar."}]},{"heading":"Tournament Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"t