{"type":"h","text":"Safety"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"First aid"},{"text":"CPR/BLS awareness"},{"text":"Sports injury prevention"},{"text":"Emergency coordination"},{"text":"Safe participation practices"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A student should graduate with a practical portfolio containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.P.Ed"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sports Coaching Experience"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"School Sports Internship"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Annual Sports Calendar"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Tournament Management Plan"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sports Dashboard"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Equipment Inventory System"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Student Athlete Development Plan"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sports Event Report"},{"text":"This portfolio demonstrates that the student can manage a sports program, rather than simply demonstrate personal sporting ability."}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PHYSICAL EDUCATION"},{"text":"├── Anatomy & Physiology"},{"text":"├── Fitness"},{"text":"├── Sports Science"},{"text":"└── Physical Activity Programming"},{"text":"SPORTS"},{"text":"├── Multi-Sport Knowledge"},{"text":"├── Coaching"},{"text":"├── Rules & Regulations"},{"text":"├── Talent Identification"},{"text":"└── Athlete Development"},{"text":"SPORTS MANAGEMENT"},{"text":"├── Event Management"},{"text":"├── Tournament Planning"},{"text":"├── Scheduling"},{"text":"├── Equipment Management"},{"text":"├── Budgeting"},{"text":"└── Facility Coordination"},{"text":"STUDENT DEVELOPMENT"},{"text":"├── Team Building"},{"text":"├── Leadership"},{"text":"├── Motivation"},{"text":"├── Inclusion"},{"text":"└── Student Engagement"},{"text":"DIGITAL"},{"text":"├── Excel"},{"text":"├── Google Sheets"},{"text":"├── Power BI"},{"text":"├── Sports Analytics"},{"text":"├── Video Analysis"},{"text":"└── AI Literacy"},{"text":"SAFETY"},{"text":"├── First Aid"},{"text":"├── CPR/BLS"},{"text":"├── Injury Prevention"},{"text":"└── Emergency Coordination"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"“A school sports professional who combines physical-education expertise, coaching, tournament management, student-athlete development, sports analytics and operational coordination to build a safe, inclusive and high-performing school sports program.”"},{"type":"p","text":"For career-fitment purposes, School Sports Coordinator is best mapped to students with strong interests in sports, physical activity, leadership, teamwork, event management, student development, communication and organized execution."},{"type":"p","text":"A realistic entry route is usually B.P.Ed → Physical Education Teacher/Sports Instructor → Sports Coordination → School Sports Coordinator, rather than expecting direct appointment to a coordinator position immediately after graduation."}]}]}